<title>QATAR: UK signs $825 mln arms deal with Qatar.</title>
<headline>UK signs $825 mln arms deal with Qatar.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain and Qatar on Sunday signed a $825 million deal to supply the Gulf Arab state with armoured vehicles, patrol boats, missiles and Hawk trainer aircraft, the British embassy said.</p>
<p>The deal was signed by British Defence Secretary Michael Portillo and Qatari officials in Doha, an embassy spokesman said.</p>
</text>
